  "_comment": "Copy to .mcp.json (git-ignored) and adjust for your machine. Requires the Unity CLI installed AND a Unity Editor running with com.unity.pipeline. See tools/unity-cli/README.md. Claude Code will prompt to approve this server on next start.",
